\"#c0392b\"/>\n<text x=\"385\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">-7.4%</text>\n<text x=\"442\" y=\"298\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#212529\">IN Fin.Svcs+Cons.Cyc.</text>\n<rect x=\"380\" y=\"285\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n<text x=\"374\" y=\"298\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">-8.7%</text>\n<text x=\"442\" y=\"338\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#212529\">US Financial Services</text>\n<rect x=\"377\" y=\"325\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n<text x=\"371\" y=\"338\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">-9.1%</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
