  "what-sewage-disposal-in-key-parts-of": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Ramaniyam_CMWSSB_Sholinganallur_Chennai_Jan22_R16_05545.jpg/960px-Ramaniyam_CMWSSB_Sholinganallur_Chennai_Jan22_R16_05545.jpg\" alt=\"A CMWSSB sewage treatment plant in Sholinganallur, Chennai, Tamil Nadu\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">A CMWSSB (Chennai Metropolitan Water Supply and Sewerage Board) sewage treatment plant in Sholinganallur, Chennai &mdash; the body this piece checks against the state's underground-drainage funding claims. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ramaniyam_CMWSSB_Sholinganallur_Chennai_Jan22_R16_05545.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ramaniyam CMWSSB Sholinganallur Chennai</a>, Timothy A. Gonsalves, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
