eight=\"16\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"231\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">₹236 cr</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Western Chennai stormwater (KfW)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"318\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">₹41 cr</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
